  ],
  "abstract": "W e introduce the notion of central extension of gerbes on a to po- logical space X. W e show that there are obstruction classes to lifting objec ts and isomorphisms in a central extension. W e also discuss pro nilpotent gerbes. These results are used in the paper [Ye] to study twisted defo rmation quanti- zation on algebraic varieties.",
